      "value": "subject_definitions:\n\n<Subject 1> is NEKRON, very long white hair, pale skin, and dark purple robes, shown in <Picture 1>.\n\n\n\nsummary:\n\n[audio reuse] A technicolor 80s sword-and-sandals epic, shot on 35mm: a single continuous live-action scene of NEKRON, preserving each character's appearance from their reference sheet and the spoken dialogue and timing of the reference audio.\n\n\n\nretention_analysis:\n\n<Subject 1>: fully_preserved \u2014 keep very long white hair, pale skin, and dark purple robes consistent across [Shot 1] and [Shot 2].\nReference audio: fully_copy \u2014 reuse the spoken lines and their exact timing.\n<Picture 2>: background_only \u2014 this is the location as a painted environment, not people; keep ONLY the environment (layout, lighting, color, architecture) and ignore any figures.\n\n\n\ndetailed_description:\n\na technicolor 80s sword-and-sandals epic, shot on 35mm: vivid saturated colour, deep blacks and high contrast, practical sets, high-fantasy practical effects on an unlimited budget, vast torchlit stone halls with heavy drapery, brass and gold, jewelled saturated colour\n\nONLY the named characters are present in the shot \u2014 there are no other people, no crowd, no background figures and no extras at any point. The scene is quiet, intimate and relaxed. The characters stay where they are; nobody walks, enters, or moves toward the camera.\n\nTwo people are visible in total, both main characters with no background extras. The first person, with long white hair, is standing and facing slightly to the right of the camera, with arms extended outward. The second person, with long black hair, is standing and facing slightly to the left of the camera, with one fist raised. Both are in a dimly lit cavernous space with rocky walls and glowing blue-green light in the background.\n\n[Shot 1] The camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed, tightening toward the face. <Subject 1> (S1) says: <d>[English] As to your sister...</d> <Subject 1> (S1) says: <d>[English] I must admit that until this moment...</d> <Subject 1> (S1) says: <d>[English] the idea of mating with her filled me with loathing.</d>\n\n[Shot 2] The camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed, tightening toward the face. The move slows and stops as the figure settles. <Subject 1> (S1) says: <d>[English] Perhaps I should reconsider.</d>\n\n\n\noverall_soundscape:\n\nRoom reverb and a low air movement through stone, distant movement echoing off hard surfaces, cloth and body movement.\n\n\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\n\nHeavy percussion and low brass at a fast, driving tempo, rising steadily in volume through the passage and cutting off hard at the end."
